<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Jos=C3=A9 Mourinho would like everyone to =
know that he has moved on. The Big Cup, after all, is the one trophy he fai=
led to win during his first spell at Real Madrid. So, ahead of Tuesday=E2=
=80=99s meeting with Serie A champions Inter at the Bernab=C3=A9u, it seeme=
d reasonable to ask whether there was unfinished business. Nope. =E2=80=9CW=
hen I left in 2013, we won what we won and lost what we lost, and we gave i=
t our all,=E2=80=9D Mourinho tooted. =E2=80=9CWhat I need to do now has not=
hing to do with the past.=E2=80=9D Fair enough. Although it is worth rememb=
ering that when Mourinho arrived in Madrid in 2010, the club were strugglin=
g even to make the latter stages of Europe=E2=80=99s premier competition. N=
ow they have won six Champions Leagues in a little over a decade. So perhap=
s the past is best left alone.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The present, meanwhile, contains a slightl=
y awkward <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_=
JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPgmeSpFqlMVAip-q=
LJDGNfV20CQTv7oeN5UOFvk5h_0MWFMDPLNBif2hNB-eYYLfA1wUZKQ29OOPLq2WMT2mWbJ3Cru=
CYDodUvSp3vrKd80RY0fSLFgi6DBSO8wwMcEORPEH2eBDO7WTR_9TeDuODpcL6F2W3cS2F9cwlq=
GQlz2PBtytQZDaXUYCulT-l6Lb7MvQeRYTAkDJU7Hsl4k4hhxvrM9qk_FxUvgMd0q1bHlMuisXW=
nltn-ulogt_agLBbfukdxkUDaKEEM6Wm0X8z9dA/4tu/zuSGXgvCSGuc3ud_pNwGuA/h43/h001=
.GxutgRDuwUnMv96Io6OB95wa545s2I0fdY7fZmuDkjk" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">1-0=
 defeat by Real Betis</a> on Friday. Not quite the ideal preparation for a =
Champions League opener, particularly at a club where =E2=80=9Cgive it time=
=E2=80=9D has never been the most popular phrase in the vocabulary.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Mourinho knows this. Stability, he said, i=
s the answer. =E2=80=9CWe want to win every match, every competition. But y=
ou have to work to accomplish stability. Stability. Stability =E2=80=A6 Str=
ucture.=E2=80=9D Madrid have not won a major trophy for two seasons. Kylian=
 Mbapp=C3=A9 arrived amid enormous expectation. Mourinho is back, carrying =
all the old Mourinho baggage while insisting the past is irrelevant. And Bi=
g Cup, naturally, remains the competition by which everything at the Bernab=
=C3=A9u is eventually measured. No pressure, then.</p>
